WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Ken blocks DI against the wall and is wall-splatted.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.650
Standing light kick begins the juggle.

3
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.650
Standing heavy punch follows the light kick.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.650
Crouching heavy kick continues the juggle.

5
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.800
The final target press completes the drinking knockdown.
